  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/MES/BH_ME_HEADER.webp\" alt=\"横幅\"></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fD1D8LKA5N\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://ko-fi.com/img/githubbutton_sm.svg\" alt=\"Ko-fi\"></a></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252fS5nffJbuvA\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/869218732650688543?color=9033af&amp;label=DISCORD&amp;style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"Discord\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/finndog_123/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/CurseForge-projects-9033af?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=curseforge\" alt=\"CurseForge 项目\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fFinnDog_123\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Modrinth-projects-9033af?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=modrinth\" alt=\"Modrinth 项目\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fpreviews.moogsmods.com%252fend-structures%252f1.21.1%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://pub-24a4e0e7ea8544a5b6f73c3a23512589.r2.dev/images/c110cc09347a4f9f9de6c974f2fa35d8.png\" alt=\"查看结构\"></a></p><p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/MES/BH_ME_BANNER1.webp\" alt=\"概述\"></p><p>此模组适用于 Forge、Fabric、NeoForge 和 Quilt！它还可以仅安装在服务器端。1.20.4 版本后不再支持 Forge。</p><h3>关于</h3><p>Moog's End Structures 通过引入一系列全新的结构，为末地维度注入新的活力，这些结构与现有景观完美融合。每个结构都精心使用原版方块和实体制作，以保持经典的 Minecraft 风格。当您探索末地时，会遭遇独特的挑战、强敌和珍贵的战利品。该模组可与任何整合包兼容，并能与 Moog's Voyager Structures (MVS) 一起安装，以获得更丰富的游戏体验。深入末地，探索 Moog's End Structures 中隐藏的宝藏吧！</p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fpreviews.moogsmods.com%252fend-structures%252f1.21.1%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://pub-24a4e0e7ea8544a5b6f73c3a23512589.r2.dev/images/f8fe835413394a76b10a678afefea30f.png\" alt=\"在线浏览每个结构的3D预览\"></a></p><p>查看我们的主要结构模组 MVS，请点击<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/moogs-voyager-structures\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">此处</a>。</p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fminecraftstorage.com%252fmods%252fmes-moogs-end-structures\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/ApCtgr7.png\" alt=\"MinecraftStorage\"></a></p><div><h3><strong>Biomes O Plenty</strong> 兼容性数据包</h3><br><div>我专门为 Moog's End Structures 制作了一个兼容性数据包，以增强其与热门模组 <strong>Biomes O Plenty</strong> 的整合效果。此数据包会将部分现有结构的样式切换为使用 BOP 中的方块，使两个模组同时安装时获得更协调、更具沉浸感的体验。您可以在<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/data-packs/mes-biomes-o-plenty-compat-pack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">此处</a>查找并下载该兼容性数据包。</div></div><p>&nbsp;</p><h3>配置包</h3><p>模组的每个方面都可以通过数据包进行自定义。包含完整说明的模板可在<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mes-moogs-end-structures-config-pack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">此处</a>找到。</p><p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/MES/BH_ME_BANNER2.webp\" alt=\"特性\"> <img src=\"https://imgur.com/YPIvnN1.png\" alt=\"拼贴图\"></p><p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/MES/BH_ME_BANNER2.webp\" alt=\"展示\"></p><h3>视频</h3><div><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/gqCYji1o2Xs?wmode=transparent&amp;start=102\" width=\"320\" height=\"180\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/1XGKnGel1oI?wmode=transparent&amp;start=239\" width=\"320\" height=\"180\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/khBGeEdrWuc?wmode=transparent\" width=\"320\" height=\"180\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><h3>整合包</h3><p>查看所有整合包，请点击<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.modpackindex.com%252fmodpack%252ffinder%253fincluded_mods%253d46028\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">此处</a>。</p><p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/MES/BH_ME_BANNER3.webp\" alt=\"DISCORD\"></p><p>获取回复的最佳最快方式是加入我们的<a href=\"https://discord.gg/S5nffJbuvA\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord 服务器</a>。</p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fmoogsmods%253fr%253dcfmes\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/MES/BH_ME_PROMO.webp\" alt=\"BH赞助\"></a></p>",
